Error: Jet.CheckedTextHoleSlot: `db.SQL` refuses this hole's type where it sits
  --> Tests/UI/sql_head_name_hole_needs_sqlname.jet:7:50
    |
  7 |     q2: SQL{"SELECT * FROM users WHERE owner = '{owner}'"}
    |                                                  ^^^^^
 Why: A hole cannot sit inside a SQL string literal; drop the quotes and write `{value}` so it binds as a parameter
 Fix: Pass a value of a type this place accepts, or move the hole to a place that accepts its type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CheckedTextHoleSlot

